DF.EXE evidence: tools/inspect-dust-turns.py, hash-checked read-only disassembly
in build/dust-turn-original-disasm.log. All three movement audits pass, including
callback state, same-facing turns, replacement without arrival and nested waits
(build/dust-turn-callback-cast-audit.log).
